{"title":"불사신왕무쌍기","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=eawFlR/hAdNXny20T/mOjNEfpfS7g0RqJsL3IXE1&filename=th3","synopsis":"심장병으로 몸이 약했던 진현. 어느 날 우연히 고양이로 인해 '불사신석'의 주인이 되고, 그로 인해 불사신의 몸으로 변하게 된다. \n강철같은 피부와 죽지 않는 몸, 갖은 무공 스킬들, 정말 무적이나 다름없는 존재가 되었으나, 큰 힘을 가지며 그만큼 이를 빼앗으려는 이들도 등장하는 법.\n불사신석을 노리는 무리들 덕에 하루도 몸이 남아나질 않는다.\n엎친 데 덮친 격으로 '천겁'이라는 세계멸망을 막아야 하는 사명까지 주어지게 된 몸!\n진현은 과연 불사신석을 무사히 지켜내고, 세계멸망을 막아낼 수 있을까?","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":290,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-30","rank":275,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-01","rank":217,"change":{"type":"up","amount":58}},{"date":"2026-10-04","rank":288,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-11","rank":293,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-24","rank":276,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-25","rank":232,"change":{"type":"up","amount":44}},{"date":"2026-10-26","rank":255,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":808702,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc":692},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":808727,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc":692},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":808737,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc":692},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":808748,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc":692},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":808763,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc":692},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":808776,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc":692},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":808792,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc":692},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":808807,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc":692},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":808818,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc":692},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":808840,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc":692},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":808849,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc":692},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":808862,"rc":1034,"rs":9122,"cc"